      "content": "hey, i'm 67 and i've been on a daily baby aspirin for my heart for years. my lower back is just killing me lately though, like a constant ache. i was thinking about getting some advil to help with the pain so i don't have to go through the whole hassle of making a doctor's appointment and waiting in a clinic. is it alright to take the advil along with my aspirin? i've heard some people say it's fine.",
